{%- liquid
  assign grey_cookie_policy_url = routes.root_url | append: 'pages/contact?view=cookie-policy'
  assign grey_privacy_url = routes.root_url | append: 'policies/privacy-policy'
  if shop.privacy_policy != blank
    assign grey_privacy_url = shop.privacy_policy.url
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="grey-cookie-consent"
  data-grey-cookie-consent
  data-cookie-policy-url="{{ grey_cookie_policy_url }}"
>
  <section
    class="grey-cookie-banner"
    data-grey-cookie-banner
    aria-labelledby="GreyCookieBannerTitle"
    hidden
  >
    <div class="grey-cookie-banner__copy">
      <h2 id="GreyCookieBannerTitle">Your privacy choices</h2>
      <p>
        Grey Exim uses necessary technologies for our store, cart, checkout and security. With your permission,
        we also use optional technologies for preferences, analytics and marketing.
        <a href="{{ grey_cookie_policy_url }}">Cookie Policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grey-cookie-banner__actions" aria-label="Cookie choices">
      <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-button grey-cookie-button--secondary" data-cookie-action="reject">
        Reject non-essential
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-button grey-cookie-button--secondary" data-cookie-action="manage">
        Manage preferences
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-button grey-cookie-button--primary" data-cookie-action="accept">
        Accept all
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grey-cookie-modal" data-grey-cookie-modal hidden>
    <button
      type="button"
      class="grey-cookie-modal__overlay"
      data-cookie-action="close"
      aria-label="Close cookie settings"
      tabindex="-1"
    ></button>
    <section
      class="grey-cookie-modal__panel"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-labelledby="GreyCookieSettingsTitle"
      aria-describedby="GreyCookieSettingsIntroduction"
    >
      <header class="grey-cookie-modal__header">
        <div>
          <p class="grey-cookie-modal__eyebrow">Grey Exim privacy</p>
          <h2 id="GreyCookieSettingsTitle">Cookie settings</h2>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-modal__close" data-cookie-action="close" aria-label="Close cookie settings">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l16 16M20 4L4 20"/></svg>
        </button>
      </header>

      <div class="grey-cookie-modal__body">
        <div class="grey-cookie-modal__intro" id="GreyCookieSettingsIntroduction">
          <p>
            At Grey Exim, we respect your privacy and give you control over how optional cookies and similar
            technologies are used on <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">www.greyexim.com</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Necessary technologies support our website, shopping cart, checkout and security. With your permission
            where required, optional technologies may support preferences, analytics, performance, personalization
            and marketing. Changing your choices does not affect technologies that are strictly necessary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grey-cookie-categories">
          <details class="grey-cookie-category" open>
            <summary>
              <span>
                <strong>Strictly necessary</strong>
                <small>Required for the website to function</small>
              </span>
              <span class="grey-cookie-category__status">Always active</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="grey-cookie-category__content">
              <p>These technologies cannot normally be switched off through Cookie Settings. They may be used to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>operate our ecommerce website and maintain your shopping cart;</li>
                <li>support checkout, secure browsing sessions and customer accounts;</li>
                <li>remember privacy choices, location, market or currency settings;</li>
                <li>prevent fraud or misuse and provide services requested by you.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Blocking them in your browser may cause parts of the website to stop working correctly.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="grey-cookie-category">
            <summary>
              <span>
                <strong>Preferences and functionality</strong>
                <small>Remember choices and optional features</small>
              </span>
              <label class="grey-cookie-switch" aria-label="Allow preference cookies">
                <input type="checkbox" data-cookie-consent="preferences">
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </label>
            </summary>
            <div class="grey-cookie-category__content">
              <p>
                These technologies can remember language, country or market, currency, localization and other
                customer preferences. If disabled, some optional features may not work as intended.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="grey-cookie-category">
            <summary>
              <span>
                <strong>Analytics and performance</strong>
                <small>Help us measure and improve the store</small>
              </span>
              <label class="grey-cookie-switch" aria-label="Allow analytics cookies">
                <input type="checkbox" data-cookie-consent="analytics">
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </label>
            </summary>
            <div class="grey-cookie-category__content">
              <p>
                These technologies help us understand visits, sessions, pages and products viewed, store navigation,
                shopping interactions, website performance and how visitors reach Grey Exim. Where required, they
                are used only after consent.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="grey-cookie-category">
            <summary>
              <span>
                <strong>Marketing and advertising</strong>
                <small>Measure campaigns and improve relevance</small>
              </span>
              <label class="grey-cookie-switch" aria-label="Allow marketing cookies">
                <input type="checkbox" data-cookie-consent="marketing">
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </label>
            </summary>
            <div class="grey-cookie-category__content">
              <p>
                Where enabled, these technologies may measure advertising effectiveness, campaign engagement and
                conversions, understand advertising referrals, support audience measurement and provide more relevant
                marketing. Where consent is required, they are used according to your choice.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <details class="grey-cookie-more">
          <summary>Browser controls and more information</summary>
          <div>
            <p>
              Most browsers let you view, delete or block cookies. Blocking all cookies can affect the cart, customer
              account, checkout, saved preferences and other essential ecommerce features.
            </p>
            <p>
              Read our <a href="{{ grey_cookie_policy_url }}">Cookie Policy</a> and
              <a href="{{ grey_privacy_url }}">Privacy Statement</a>, or contact
              <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact#send-us-email">care@greyexim.com</a> with privacy questions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <p class="grey-cookie-modal__status" data-cookie-status aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>

      <footer class="grey-cookie-modal__footer">
        <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-button grey-cookie-button--secondary" data-cookie-action="reject">
          Reject non-essential
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="grey-cookie-button grey-cookie-button--primary" data-cookie-action="save">
          Save preferences
        </button>
      </footer>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
